@base = http://localhost:3000

GET {{base}}/api/accounts

### Exposição e limite por ativo
GET {{base}}/api/accounts/CLIENTE-001/exposures

### Nova identidade deve ser um UUID v4 real gerado pelo cliente
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clOrdId": "ed0f4b17-d1ca-4f5f-9d31-f15ec0b2f155",
  "accountId": "CLIENTE-001",
  "symbol": "PETR4",
  "side": "B",
  "quantity": 100,
  "price": "35.50"
}

### Consultar status
GET {{base}}/api/orders/ed0f4b17-d1ca-4f5f-9d31-f15ec0b2f155

### Auditoria eventual
GET {{base}}/api/orders/ed0f4b17-d1ca-4f5f-9d31-f15ec0b2f155/events

### Recentes
GET {{base}}/api/orders
